    "detailed_description": "<strong>Your goal: Escape to the ghosts and collect bonuses to destroy them!</strong><br><br>Also playable without a VR headset on a 2D screen!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li> Choose your game mode: God Mode or First-Person View<br><br>    </li><li> VR In-Game Level Editor:<br>Make your customs levels, put blocs, bonuses, ghosts, textures, musics ... fly in your creations in VR.<br><br>    </li><li> More than 15 official maps<br><br>    </li><li> Destructible environment<br><br>    </li><li> A.I.: Ghosts can analyze changes to their environment and even break walls<br><br>    </li><li> 3 attack bonuses: Proximity bomb, Fireball and Wall breaker<br><br>    </li><li> 3 defense bonuses: Invulnerability, Ultra Speed and Invisibility</li></ul>",
